# NEWS roadmap pointer

Before choosing “what to build next”, read [docs/ROADMAP.md](../../docs/ROADMAP.md).

- **Current next** is the preferred order; Jira is status source of truth
- Parked epics stay parked unless the user explicitly reorders
- If Jira and the doc disagree, **Jira wins** — update `docs/ROADMAP.md` in the same change set. Exception: the 2026-11-12 next-wave pause (NEWS-201, NEWS-202, NEWS-203, and NEWS-219 through NEWS-223). Those tickets stay To Do in Jira until the UI build order is proposed. Dev-tooling NEWS-139, NEWS-128, and NEWS-121 are not paused. Do not start them, and do not rewrite the roadmap to match that To Do status.
